# Kit 1.2 Jet forms Kesh undid on 19 Nov (kept for the record)
up(11,'J', name="逆水 Treadmill", short="a current under her stream's foe, 4 s: it must walk against it and cannot come nearer to her",
   full="no line from her: the current lies under the foe her stream is on (stream off: the foe nearest the pointer within 5 u), follows it and runs away from her, 4 s: 6 a second, soaks. The foe walks against it: a small foe or elite cannot come nearer to her; a champion comes at half speed. It can still shoot, and strike what is in its reach; a leap or a charge crosses it. Not a hold",
   idea="Treadmill: the foe runs on the spot", boss="not held back: the ticks 20% more, and it stays soaked", beat="Zone pulse, a strip", sound="fast water, feet slapping", ai="on the melee foe nearest her",
   motion="she flicks the staff's tip at the foe's feet; a strip of fast water unrolls under it, running away from her; the foe runs on the spot, arms pumping.")
up(12,'J', name="水锯 Buzz saw", short="the pool stands up as a saw that rolls along her aim; a big foe stops it and it grinds there",
   full="no pool, no drag, no slow: the water stands on edge as a spinning saw, 1.4 u tall, and rolls from her along her aim at 1 u a second for 5 s: 2 each 0.25 s to a foe it touches, soaks (and again at once after a Crash, as the base). It rolls over small foes; an elite, champion or boss stops it, and it grinds on that foe until its time ends",
   idea="Buzz saw: a rolling saw that stops on a big foe", boss="it stops on it and grinds: this is its use", beat="In flight, a disc", sound="a wet whine, rising on a big foe", ai="at the biggest foe, through the small ones",
   motion="she tips the staff sideways and the pool rises on edge, a wheel of water with a toothed rim; it rolls off slowly, throwing spray, and bites into a big foe with a whine.")
up(14,'J', name="倒滑 Kickback", short="the stream's kick drives her: 1.5 s she slides away from where she aims, and the stream never stops",
   full="no wave: for 1.5 s the stream's kick drives her: she slides at dash speed away from where she aims, and the stream stays on (the one move that carries her and does not pause it, R8). Aim at a foe to back away from it; aim behind her to charge. Foes she slides past: 14, soaked, knocked 1 u aside",
   idea="Kickback: her own stream pushes her", boss="not knocked aside: 20% more", beat="Dash", sound="the pour, louder, and a long skid", ai="when a melee foe reaches her while a big foe is in the stream",
   motion="she leans back on her heels, tail down as a rudder, and the stream shoves her backward across the floor like a water-skier, spray off both feet.")
up(15,'J', name="水剪 Shears", short="two blades snip one foe: 36, no stun; its next attack deals half",
   full="no walls, no stun: two blades of water close on one foe like shears (the foe her stream is on; stream off: the foe nearest the pointer within 5 u): 18 each. Crash, once. The snip cuts its next blow short: the next attack it starts within 3 s deals half (a champion's too; a boss's a quarter less)",
   idea="Shears: the foe's next attack is cut in half", boss="its next attack within 3 s deals a quarter less", beat="Placed, two blades", sound="one clean snip", ai="on a foe that winds up a heavy blow",
   motion="the left paw chops down: two flat blades rise at the foe's sides and cross through it with one clean snip; its raised weapon droops.")
up(16,'J', name="漩心 Vortex seed", short="fired into one foe: 40; it stays inside 6 s: every Crash on that foe sets it off again: 16",
   full="no draw, no ring: the maelstrom is spun small and fired down her stream into the foe at its end (stream off: the first foe on her aim within 6 u): 40. Crash. It stays inside that foe for 6 s as a turning spiral: every cast of hers that Crashes the foe sets it off: 16 more to it and to foes within 1.5 u (once a cast). If the foe falls, the seed jumps to the nearest foe within 4 u with the time it has left",
   idea="Vortex seed: a spiral inside the foe that answers every Crash", boss="as written: this is its use", beat="Shot; a small Nova at each burst", sound="a whirr going in; a muffled thump at each burst", ai="on a boss or champion, before her Crash skills",
   motion="she coils once round the staff and jabs: the whole spiral shrinks to a top the size of her paw, runs down the stream and sinks into the foe's chest; a faint spiral turns on it and thumps at each Crash.")
